  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Oh, important meeting.",
      "startMs": 8110,
      "endMs": 10690
    },
    {
      "text": "Everyone must come.",
      "startMs": 11050,
      "endMs": 12350
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, back to work, and my boss has called a meeting.",
      "startMs": 13970,
      "endMs": 17790
    },
    {
      "text": "I wonder what it's about.",
      "startMs": 18310,
      "endMs": 20270
    },
    {
      "text": "Maybe we're all getting raises!",
      "startMs": 21210,
      "endMs": 22750
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, there's Jonathan.",
      "startMs": 23230,
      "endMs": 25250
    },
    {
      "text": "Maybe he knows.",
      "startMs": 25750,
      "endMs": 26590
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm Professor Bot.",
      "startMs": 29480,
      "endMs": 30780
    },
    {
      "text": "This video is all about work.",
      "startMs": 31520,
      "endMs": 34180
    },
    {
      "text": "People talk about jobs and things that happen at work.",
      "startMs": 34620,
      "endMs": 38580
    },
    {
      "text": "Your assignment is to find as many work words as you can.",
      "startMs": 38580,
      "endMs": 44160
    },
    {
      "text": "Don't worry.",
      "startMs": 44620,
      "endMs": 45620
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll help.",
      "startMs": 46200,
      "endMs": 47300
    },
    {
      "text": "So, Jonathan, what do you think today's meeting is about?",
      "startMs": 49200,
      "endMs": 52760
    },
    {
      "text": "The email sounded important.",
      "startMs": 53340,
      "endMs": 55340
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, I have heard people in the building talking about budget cuts.",
      "startMs": 56300,
      "endMs": 61280
    },
    {
      "text": "Ah!",
      "startMs": 62080,
      "endMs": 62360
    },
    {
      "text": "Budget cuts?",
      "startMs": 63240,
      "endMs": 64120
    },
    {
      "text": "Wait, who has been talking about budget cuts?",
      "startMs": 65150,
      "endMs": 68790
    },
    {
      "text": "Mark in accounting.",
      "startMs": 68790,
      "endMs": 70430
    },
    {
      "text": "Mark in accounting?",
      "startMs": 71510,
      "endMs": 72490
    },
    {
      "text": "That's one person!",
      "startMs": 72870,
      "endMs": 74250
    },
    {
      "text": "That's not people!",
      "startMs": 74570,
      "endMs": 75470
    },
    {
      "text": "I know, but Mark knows everything that goes on at the studio.",
      "startMs": 76330,
      "endMs": 80570
    },
    {
      "text": "That is true.",
      "startMs": 81390,
      "endMs": 82450
    },
    {
      "text": "But wait, look at us.",
      "startMs": 84110,
      "endMs": 85770
    },
    {
      "text": "We shouldn't gossip.",
      "startMs": 86230,
      "endMs": 87350
    },
    {
      "text": "That's how rumors start.",
      "startMs": 87830,
      "endMs": 89470
    },
    {
      "text": "We'll just go to the meeting and see what happens.",
      "startMs": 90720,
      "endMs": 93840
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, you're right.",
      "startMs": 94560,
      "endMs": 95300
    },
    {
      "text": "No more talk about budget cuts.",
      "startMs": 95920,
      "endMs": 97840
    },
    {
      "text": "Budget cuts?",
      "startMs": 100120,
      "endMs": 101840
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, no!",
      "startMs": 102370,
      "endMs": 103430
    },
    {
      "text": "I just heard Anna and Jonathan talking about budget cuts.",
      "startMs": 105800,
      "endMs": 110040
    },
    {
      "text": "That must be what the meeting is about.",
      "startMs": 110990,
      "endMs": 113090
    },
    {
      "text": "When they're budget cuts, people lose their jobs.",
      "startMs": 113770,
      "endMs": 116970
    },
    {
      "text": "Not you.",
      "startMs": 117770,
      "endMs": 118650
    },
    {
      "text": "You're a good reporter.",
      "startMs": 119350,
      "endMs": 120590
    },
    {
      "text": "And it's not you.",
      "startMs": 121390,
      "endMs": 122430
    },
    {
      "text": "You've done such a great job as a videographer.",
      "startMs": 122970,
      "endMs": 125930
    },
    {
      "text": "I can't go back to being a detective.",
      "startMs": 127040,
      "endMs": 129720
    },
    {
      "text": "Criminals scare me!",
      "startMs": 130640,
      "endMs": 132320
    },
    {
      "text": "And I can't go back to being a teacher.",
      "startMs": 132860,
      "endMs": 135120
    },
    {
      "text": "High school kids scare me.",
      "startMs": 135780,
      "endMs": 137600
    },
    {
      "text": "Did you hear any work words?",
      "startMs": 138300,
      "endMs": 141440
    },
    {
      "text": "They talked about a lot of jobs.",
      "startMs": 141820,
      "endMs": 144340
    },
    {
      "text": "You can make the name of a job by adding an ending to a verb.",
      "startMs": 145040,
      "endMs": 149260
    },
    {
      "text": "Cave reports.",
      "startMs": 149960,
      "endMs": 151100
    },
    {
      "text": "So he's a reporter.",
      "startMs": 152040,
      "endMs": 153800
    },
    {
      "text": "Amelia used to detect.",
      "startMs": 153800,
      "endMs": 157120
    },
    {
      "text": "So she was a detective.",
      "startMs": 157660,
      "endMs": 160740
    },
    {
      "text": "If you teach, you're a teacher.",
      "startMs": 161660,
      "endMs": 164720
    },
    {
      "text": "And a videographer, I think you understand.",
      "startMs": 165040,
      "endMs": 169120
    },
    {
      "text": "Back to the story.",
      "startMs": 169960,
      "endMs": 171060
    },
    {
      "text": "Penelope, have you heard the news?",
      "startMs": 171560,
      "endMs": 173800
    },
    {
      "text": "Today's meeting is about budget cuts.",
      "startMs": 174480,
      "endMs": 176740
    },
    {
      "text": "That's awful.",
      "startMs": 177080,
      "endMs": 178060
    },
    {
      "text": "What should I do?",
      "startMs": 179100,
      "endMs": 180360
    },
    {
      "text": "Update your resume.",
      "startMs": 180360,
      "endMs": 181760
    },
    {
      "text": "I've already updated mine.",
      "startMs": 182260,
      "endMs": 184120
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll see you at the meeting.",
      "startMs": 184940,
      "endMs": 186320
    },
    {
      "text": "Hello everyone.",
      "startMs": 193370,
      "endMs": 194540
    },
    {
      "text": "Quiet please.",
      "startMs": 195000,
      "endMs": 196040
    },
    {
      "text": "Quiet please.",
      "startMs": 196760,
      "endMs": 197560
    },
    {
      "text": "This meeting won't take long.",
      "startMs": 199590,
      "endMs": 201210
    },
    {
      "text": "Then you can all leave.",
      "startMs": 201710,
      "endMs": 203270
    },
    {
      "text": "What is wrong with everyone?",
      "startMs": 204460,
      "endMs": 206220
    },
    {
      "text": "You look like I'm going to fire you.",
      "startMs": 207000,
      "endMs": 209380
    },
    {
      "text": "Seriously, what is wrong with everyone?",
      "startMs": 212580,
      "endMs": 215220
    },
    {
      "text": "Excuse me, Ms.",
      "startMs": 216980,
      "endMs": 218300
    },
    {
      "text": "Weaver.",
      "startMs": 218440,
      "endMs": 218620
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, I'm Anna.",
      "startMs": 218880,
      "endMs": 219220
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, everyone has been worrying about, you know, we've been worrying that you're going to fire us.",
      "startMs": 219720,
      "endMs": 241970
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm not going to fire any of you.",
      "startMs": 242450,
      "endMs": 244610
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "startMs": 244610,
      "endMs": 245250
    },
    {
      "text": "The reason for this meeting is to tell you what a good job you've been doing.",
      "startMs": 247290,
      "endMs": 252170
    },
    {
      "text": "And give out new assignments.",
      "startMs": 252530,
      "endMs": 254730
    },
    {
      "text": "Budget cuts have been happening.",
      "startMs": 256470,
      "endMs": 258590
    },
    {
      "text": "But only one person has lost their job.",
      "startMs": 259270,
      "endMs": 261950
    },
    {
      "text": "Mark, in accounting?",
      "startMs": 262690,
      "endMs": 263930
    },
    {
      "text": "Now let's talk about those new assignments.",
      "startMs": 266310,
      "endMs": 268870
    },
    {
      "text": "Ms.",
      "startMs": 270770,
      "endMs": 271230
    },
    {
      "text": "Weaver's team is doing a good job.",
      "startMs": 271530,
      "endMs": 274570
    },
    {
      "text": "How did you do?",
      "startMs": 275010,
      "endMs": 275970
    },
    {
      "text": "Did you find all of the work words?",
      "startMs": 275970,
      "endMs": 279270
    },
    {
      "text": "Here's a list you can check.",
      "startMs": 279930,
      "endMs": 282310
    },
    {
      "text": "Watch again if you did not find all the words.",
      "startMs": 286760,
      "endMs": 290720
    },
    {
      "text": "Go to the VOA Learning English website to learn more.",
      "startMs": 291200,
      "endMs": 296300
    }
  ]
}